    "explanation": "Shadow Mark travels slowly, and Void Volley's projectiles launch over time, giving mobile enemies a chance to avoid both. Xal'atath has low Health, little self-peel, and only Void Step to escape. Hard engages such as Dragon's Arrow or Leap can catch her before she can reposition, especially if she has already used Void Step."
