    "explanation": "Xal'atath benefits from Maps that bring teams together for frequent fights. They give her more chances to stack Void Volley, while narrow areas make her area-of-effect skillshots easier to land. Infernal Shrines, Volskaya Foundry, and Towers of Doom have contested spaces that make Dark Heart Ritual and Shadow Mark harder to avoid.\n\nShe struggles on Maps where enemies can flank from several directions. Her low Health and predictable Void Step make it hard to escape once surrounded."
