  "builds": [
    {
      "name": "Dark Heart Ritual Build",
      "label": "Recommended",
      "description": "The Dark Heart Ritual Build controls space, especially at narrow choke points. Dark Heart Ritual should be placed across paths enemies must take to advance or retreat, forcing them to take damage and, with Pull of the Dark Heart, be Slowed.\n\nThis Build is also strong on Maps with channeled Objectives, such as Cursed Hollow and Towers of Doom. With Anchored Core, the Dark Heart lasts 10 seconds and Dark Heart Ritual has a 15-second cooldown. By placing it on the Objective every 15 seconds, Xal'atath can stall its 6-second channel on her own indefinitely, as long as she stays in range and can keep casting.",
